        "content": "Prov 01. Följ användarens instruktioner. Ange osäkerhet när underlag saknas."
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Skriv endast Python-kod för merge_intervals(xs). xs är en lista av par (start, end), start <= end. Returnera sorterade, sammanslagna slutna intervall som lista av tupler. Intervall som överlappar eller delar ändpunkt slås ihop; (1,2) och (3,4) slås inte ihop. Ändra inte indata. Hantera tom lista, dubbletter och nollängdsintervall. Använd bara standardbiblioteket."
      }
    ]
  },
  "started_unix": 1791356469.4713225,
  "wall_s": 43.75784089000081,
  "first_token_s": 15.731260608001321,
  "content": "```python\ndef merge_intervals(xs):\n    if not xs:\n        return []\n    \n    # Sort by start, then by end\n    sorted_xs = sorted(xs, key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1]))\n    \n    merged = []\n    current_start, current_end = sorted_xs[0]\n    \n    for start, end in sorted_xs[1:]:\n        # If the current interval overlaps or touches the previous one\n        if start <= current_end:\n            # Merge by extending the end if necessary\n            if end > current_end:\n                current_end = end\n        else:\n            # No overlap, add the previous interval and start a new one\n            merged.append((current_start, current_end))\n            current_start, current_end = start, end\n    \n    # Add the last interval\n    merged.append((current_start, current_end))\n    \n    return merged\n```",
